@startuml state-hour-block
title HourBlock state diagram
hide empty description

[*] --> AVAILABLE : HoursGenerated\n[weekly pattern published and tutor has an enabled skill]

AVAILABLE --> HELD : student selects the hour\n/ heldBy = student, heldUntil = now + 5 min
HELD --> AVAILABLE : hold expires [now > heldUntil]\n/ scheduled job releases it
HELD --> AVAILABLE : student leaves the confirmation
HELD --> BOOKED : ConfirmBooking [credits charged]\n/ bookingId = booking.id

AVAILABLE --> WITHDRAWN : tutor removes availability or pauses\n/ HoursWithdrawn
HELD --> WITHDRAWN : tutor removes availability or pauses\n/ HoursWithdrawn
WITHDRAWN --> AVAILABLE : the rules give the hour again\n[not started] / HoursGenerated
BOOKED --> AVAILABLE : student cancels\n/ BookingCancelled
BOOKED --> RELEASED : tutor cancels or removes availability\n/ BookingCancelled, incident recorded if late

BOOKED --> [*] : scheduled hour is reached
RELEASED --> [*]
WITHDRAWN --> [*] : scheduled hour is reached

note right of HELD
  Two students confirming the same hour:
  the version column makes one update fail
  (optimistic locking).
end note
@enduml
